      "description": "Vacancy overview | Working at | Erasmus University Rotterdam Skip to main content Skip to search Skip to subnavigation Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Close Open search Close Open menu Working at Erasmus University Rotterdam Switch language to EN English current language NL Nederlands Search Close Search Search Featured results Primary Why work at EUR Open submenu Why work at EUR Campus Diversity Societal involvement Sustainability Working conditions Working areas Open submenu Working areas Academic staff Working in Finance Working in IT Working at Legal Affairs Working at Real Estate & Facilities PhD LDE traineeship International staff Practical information Open submenu Practical information Candidate portal Vacancies Vacancy overview Stay up to date about new vacancies Alexander Dos Santos Listen Vacancies Filter Communication & Dissemination Officer Wil jij met jouw communicatietalent de Erasmus+‑projecten van de Erasmus Universiteit Rotterdam op de kaart zetten? Wednesday 2 Sep 2026 Wednesday 16 Sep 2026 Marketing & Communication Implementatiemanager Studentenwelzijn (0,8 – 1,0 fte) Hoe zorg je dat goede ideeën uitgroeien tot duurzame verandering? Als Implementatiemanager laat je succesvolle initiatieven landen en blijvend verankeren. Tuesday 1 Sep 2026 Wednesday 30 Sep 2026 Policy & Advice Information Specialist (0,8-1,0 fte) Would you like to show our University Library (UB) users the way to correct and reliable scientific knowledge and information? Then come strengthen our team! Tuesday 1 Sep 2026 Sunday 20 Sep 2026 Research, development, innovation Product Owner AI Tooling & Cloud ​(0,8 - 1 fte) Ben jij de Product Owner die strategie en uitvoering verbindt? Geef richting aan twee belangrijke digitale producten: het Cloud Platform en Tech & Tooling. Tuesday 1 Sep 2026 Sunday 20 Sep 2026 IT PhD Candidate on the Transimperial History of Women’s Work (1600-1900) Join the NWO Vidi project “That’s Women’s Work!” on the trans-imperial history of gendered labour: apply for one of two funded PhD positions Tuesday 1 Sep 2026 Sunday 20 Sep 2026 Research, development, innovation Projectcontroller Cijfers én impact combineren binnen de wetenschap? Word Projectcontroller bij ESSB en maak baanbrekend onderzoek financieel mogelijk. Thursday 27 Aug 2026 Sunday 13 Sep 2026 Finance Community & Engagement Coordinator (0.8-1 fte) How do you make students feel seen, heard and connected? As Community & Engagement Coordinator, you know how to bring students together and get them engaged. Thursday 27 Aug 2026 Tuesday 8 Sep 2026 Marketing & Communication Admission Officer Erasmus School of Law is op zoek naar een nieuwe collega die als Admission Officer ons team komt versterken! Wednesday 26 Aug 2026 Wednesday 16 Sep 2026 Education Postdoc Dynamiek van Armoede en Inkomen Werk, inkomen en woonplek zijn niet statisch. Onderzoek de sociaal-economische dynamiek van werkenden in armoede en bij sociale stijging. Tuesday 25 Aug 2026 Monday 14 Sep 2026 Academic staff Medewerker Tentamenorganisatie Wil jij een belangrijke rol spelen in de organisatie van toetsen voor alle EUR studenten? Tuesday 25 Aug 2026 Tuesday 8 Sep 2026 Administration & secretariat Pagination Current page 1 Page 2 Page 3 Next page Next Stay up to date with new vacancies! Want to be the first to know about vacancies that match your interests? Let us know what you're looking for, and we'll send you an email as soon as a new opportunity that fits your profile is posted.\nDon’t miss out on your perfect job! Sign up Close Stay up to date with new vacancies! Job alert Please select your preferences. When a new job becomes available that matches these preference we'll send you an email. Fields marked with a * are required. First Name Last Name Email address Password Your password requires a minimum of 8 characters of which 2 non-alphabetic Confirm password Business Unit Any Erasmus School of Economics (ESE) Erasmus School of Law (ESL) Erasmus School of Histor